{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Currently, the store text and game use machine translation, but we plan to hire a professional translator before release. Translation is scheduled to occur after the game is fully completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lazy genius scientist 'Dr. Mememe,' who just wants to sleep forever, has invented Kawaii Sheep that induce sleep with their mysterious healing powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking from a doze, the sheep invented last night were found floating and playing all around the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Wait... if I release these healing sheep outside, everyone else will be healed too.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of how the Scientist puts the world to sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010How to Play\u3011</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control the genius scientist Mememe. Grab sheep and carry them to the window.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/0c4509c6f8fbfbcfff968e9fe81a255a.poster.avif?t=1748926045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/0c4509c6f8fbfbcfff968e9fe81a255a.webm?t=1748926045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/0c4509c6f8fbfbcfff968e9fe81a255a.mp4?t=1748926045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you carry them to the window, the sheep float up into the sky and you earn points.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earned points to invent sheep production facilities or upgrade them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase sheep generation rates or strengthen the Scientist with a treadmill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-automation elements let you expand production &amp; semi-automate through inventions and upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/e335d4a05cfd4dac555632c61912829b.poster.avif?t=1748926045\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/e335d4a05cfd4dac555632c61912829b.webm?t=1748926045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/e335d4a05cfd4dac555632c61912829b.mp4?t=1748926045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple inventions appear including a sheep compressor for fusion sheep and a robot dog that herds sheep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exponentially cute sheep-carrying game with expanding production \u00d7 easy 3D action for casual enjoyment.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3386670?t=1748926045","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3386670?t=1748926045","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/23f15c6e2365204bd56a92d699b25a8bdf12333b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748926045","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/23f15c6e2365204bd56a92d699b25a8bdf12333b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748926045","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Currently, the store text and game use machine translation, but we plan to hire a professional translator before release. Translation is scheduled to occur after the game is fully completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lazy genius scientist 'Dr. Mememe,' who just wants to sleep forever, has invented Kawaii Sheep that induce sleep with their mysterious healing powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking from a doze, the sheep invented last night were found floating and playing all around the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Wait... if I release these healing sheep outside, everyone else will be healed too.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of how the Scientist puts the world to sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010How to Play\u3011</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control the genius scientist Mememe. Grab sheep and carry them to the window.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/0c4509c6f8fbfbcfff968e9fe81a255a.poster.avif?t=1748926045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/0c4509c6f8fbfbcfff968e9fe81a255a.webm?t=1748926045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/0c4509c6f8fbfbcfff968e9fe81a255a.mp4?t=1748926045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you carry them to the window, the sheep float up into the sky and you earn points.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earned points to invent sheep production facilities or upgrade them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase sheep generation rates or strengthen the Scientist with a treadmill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-automation elements let you expand production &amp; semi-automate through inventions and upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/e335d4a05cfd4dac555632c61912829b.poster.avif?t=1748926045\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/e335d4a05cfd4dac555632c61912829b.webm?t=1748926045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/e335d4a05cfd4dac555632c61912829b.mp4?t=1748926045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple inventions appear including a sheep compressor for fusion sheep and a robot dog that herds sheep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exponentially cute sheep-carrying game with expanding production \u00d7 easy 3D action for casual enjoyment.</p>","developers":["LabyLab"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/912e9dde054fb63016ead9d9005a7c8ddbf4e0e7/header.jpg?t=1748926045","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple \u30b7\u30ea\u30b3\u30f3 \u307e\u305f\u306f\u30a4\u30f3\u30c6\u30ebCore<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> </li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 Catali